#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:119
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid "Takeaway"
msgstr "Najvažnije"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:121
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Give agents autonomy over the investigation.{ph1} Set a clear goal and "
"acceptance criteria, then let the agent decide what to try next."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Prepusti agentima autonomiju nad istraživanjem.{ph1} Postavi jasan cilj"
" i kriterije prihvaćanja, a zatim agentu prepusti odluku što će sljedeće "
"isprobati."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:126
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Use the repository and Git as working memory.{ph1} Keep the reasoning "
"with the code. Git checkpoints let the next session continue after the "
"conversation ends."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Koristi repozitorij i Git kao radnu memoriju.{ph1} Čuvaj obrazloženje "
"uz kod. Git kontrolne točke omogućuju sljedećoj sesiji da nastavi nakon što "
"razgovor završi."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:131
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Let evidence decide what you claim.{ph1} A confident explanation still "
"needs testing. “Unknown” is a valid answer when the evidence is incomplete."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Neka dokazi odlučuju što tvrdiš.{ph1} Samouvjereno objašnjenje i dalje "
"treba testirati. „Nepoznato” je valjan odgovor kad su dokazi nepotpuni."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:136
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Test the oracle too.{ph1} Try cases it should reject. If it misses a "
"bug, revisit the earlier results that depended on it."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Testiraj i orakul.{ph1} Isprobaj slučajeve koje bi trebao odbiti. Ako "
"propusti grešku, ponovno pregledaj ranije rezultate koji su ovisili o njemu."

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:141
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}We are in the early days of RE's industrial revolution.{ph1} The "
"methods are still taking shape. There is plenty left to explore."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Nalazimo se u ranim danima industrijske revolucije u obrnutom "
"inženjeringu.{ph1} Metode se još oblikuju. Ostalo je još mnogo toga za "
"istražiti."

#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:153
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid "How experience compounds"
msgstr "Kako se iskustvo gomila"

