#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:154
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Setup registers REA's MCP connection and installs the matching investigation"
" skill. Restart your agent when it finishes, then give it a target path and "
"a question. {ph0}Follow the setup guide{ph1} for prerequisites and your "
"first analysis."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje registrira MCP vezu REA i instalira odgovarajući skill za "
"istraživanje. Kad završi, ponovno pokreni agenta, a zatim mu zadaj putanju "
"do cilja i pitanje. {ph0}Slijedi vodič za postavljanje{ph1} za preduvjete i "
"prvu analizu."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:163
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Which coding agents can use REA?"
msgstr "Koji agenti za programiranje mogu koristiti REA?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:164
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Any agent that supports local MCP servers. Setup includes Claude Code, "
"Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Devin, OpenCode, "
"Antigravity, GitHub Copilot CLI, Command Code, Grok Build, OMP, and VS Code."
" Grok Bot's connector is added from its chat."
msgstr ""
"Svaki agent koji podržava lokalne MCP poslužitelje. Postavljanje obuhvaća "
"Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Devin, "
"OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot CLI, Command Code, Grok Build, OMP i "
"VS Code. Konektor za Grok Bot dodaje se iz njegova chata."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#agent">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:171
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Connect your coding agent{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}Poveži svog agenta za programiranje{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:176
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "How do I update REA?"
msgstr "Kako ažuriram REA?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:177
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA releases frequently, including bug fixes. If you installed the CLI with "
"npm:"
msgstr ""
"Nova izdanja REA izlaze često, uključujući ispravke grešaka. Ako je CLI "
"instaliran pomoću npm:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:183
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · installed CLI"
msgstr "Terminal · instalirani CLI"

#. {ph0}: <code>npx</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:195
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Follow the setup refresh command printed by the update. If you set up your "
"agent through {ph0}, run:"
msgstr ""
"Slijedi naredbu za osvježavanje postavljanja koju ispiše ažuriranje. Ako je "
"agent postavljen putem {ph0}, pokreni:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:201
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · refresh agent setup"
msgstr "Terminal · osvježavanje postavljanja agenta"

#. {ph0}: <code>npx -y rea-agents@latest</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:213
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the changes and restart your agent. Its REA connection pins a package"
" version, so refreshing setup makes it use the new release. For one-off CLI "
"commands, use {ph0} followed by the command."
msgstr ""
"Pregledaj promjene i ponovno pokreni agenta. Njegova REA veza fiksira "
"verziju paketa, pa osvježavanje postavljanja čini da koristi novo izdanje. "
"Za jednokratne CLI naredbe koristi {ph0}, a nakon toga navedi naredbu."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:221
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Is installing the skill from skills.sh enough?"
msgstr "Je li dovoljno instalirati skill sa skills.sh?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#install">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:224
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"The skill gives your agent investigation instructions. Run {ph0}REA "
"setup{ph1} to connect the MCP server and install the matching skill, then "
"restart your agent so it can call the tools."
msgstr ""
"Skill agentu daje upute za istraživanje. Pokreni {ph0}REA setup{ph1} da "
"povežeš MCP poslužitelj i instaliraš odgovarajući skill, a zatim ponovno "
"pokreni agenta kako bi mogao pozivati alate."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:235
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analiza"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:238
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What can I analyze with REA?"
msgstr "Što mogu analizirati pomoću REA?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:239
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Start with the kind of software you have:"
msgstr "Počni od vrste softvera koji imaš:"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/native/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:241
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Native executables and libraries{ph1}: functions, assembly, pseudocode "
"and references."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Nativne izvršne datoteke i biblioteke{ph1}: funkcije, assembly, "
"pseudokod i reference."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:246
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}JavaScript and Electron apps{ph1}: modules, imports, IPC and source "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}JavaScript i Electron aplikacije{ph1}: moduli, importi, IPC i lokacije "
"u izvornom kodu."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/browser/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:251
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Browser pages{ph1}: scripts, requests and runtime observations."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Stranice u pregledniku{ph1}: skripte, zahtjevi i opažanja tijekom "
"izvođenja."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:256
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA also has workflows for managed assemblies, Android APKs, firmware and "
"packaged resources. {ph0}See the case studies{ph1} for worked "
"investigations."
msgstr ""
"REA ima i tijekove rada za upravljane assemblyje, Android APK-ove, firmware "
"i pakirane resurse. {ph0}Pogledaj studije slučaja{ph1} za razrađena "
"istraživanja."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:264
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Do I need Hopper, Ghidra or IDA?"
msgstr "Trebam li Hopper, Ghidra ili IDA?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:265
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Deep native analysis uses one of them. Static JavaScript and .NET inspection"
" work with the supplied files and do not need a native analysis engine."
msgstr ""
"Duboka nativna analiza koristi jedan od njih. Statički pregled JavaScripta i"
" .NET-a radi s dostavljenim datotekama i ne zahtijeva nativni analitički "
"engine."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:270
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Connect your existing Ghidra or IDA installation, or let setup detect Hopper"
" and propose an installation. Your host and target determine which provider "
"can be used. {ph0}Set up native analysis{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Poveži svoju postojeću Ghidra ili IDA instalaciju ili pusti da postavljanje "
"otkrije Hopper i predloži instalaciju. Tvoj host i cilj određuju koji se "
"provider može koristiti. {ph0}Postavi nativnu analizu{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:278
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Can I use REA without a coding agent?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti REA bez agenta za programiranje?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:279
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Yes. The CLI uses the same analysis workflows. For a local JavaScript or "
"Electron app:"
msgstr ""
"Da. CLI koristi iste tijekove analize. Za lokalnu JavaScript ili Electron "
"aplikaciju:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:285
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · static application analysis"
msgstr "Terminal · statička analiza aplikacije"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#terminal">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:298
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with an extracted application folder or ASAR file. {ph0}Use"
" the CLI{ph1} for installation options."
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni putanju mapom izdvojene aplikacije ili ASAR datotekom. {ph0}Koristi"
" CLI{ph1} za mogućnosti instalacije."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:305
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What code does REA return?"
msgstr "Koji kod REA vraća?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:306
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Native analysis returns assembly and pseudocode, with calls, references and "
"relevant constants. JavaScript analysis returns modules, their relationships"
" and source locations."
msgstr ""
"Nativna analiza vraća assembly i pseudokod, s pozivima, referencama i "
"relevantnim konstantama. JavaScript analiza vraća module, njihove odnose i "
"lokacije u izvornom kodu."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/dx-ball/#sound-pan" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="../showcase/ctf/">
#. {ph3}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:311
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent uses these findings to explain the behavior or write and test an "
"implementation. The {ph0}DX-Ball calculation{ph1} and {ph2}CTF flag "
"checker{ph3} show how that process works."
msgstr ""
"Tvoj agent koristi ove nalaze da objasni ponašanje ili da napiše i testira "
"implementaciju. {ph0}Izračun u igri DX-Ball{ph1} i {ph2}provjera CTF "
"zastavice{ph3} pokazuju kako taj proces funkcionira."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:322
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What should I ask my agent?"
msgstr "Što trebam pitati svog agenta?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:323
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Give it a local target and one behavior to investigate. For a JavaScript or "
"Electron app:"
msgstr ""
"Daj mu lokalni cilj i jedno ponašanje koje treba istražiti. Za JavaScript "
"ili Electron aplikaciju:"

#. {ph0}: <span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true" >
#. {ph1}: <i>
#. {ph2}: </i>
#. {ph3}: <i>
#. {ph4}: </i>
#. {ph5}: <i>
#. {ph6}: </i>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:329
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Your coding agent"
msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Tvoj agent za programiranje"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="faq-analysis-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no">/absolute/path/to/app</span>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph6}: </span>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:342
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to analyze {ph3} and explain how it exports data. "
"Show the relevant code and source locations.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Pomoću REA analiziraj {ph3} i objasni kako izvozi podatke. "
"Pokaži relevantan kod i lokacije u izvornom kodu.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:352
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with your target. The {ph0}guides{ph1} provide prompts for "
"native, Electron and browser examples."
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni putanju svojim ciljem. {ph0}Vodiči{ph1} nude upite za primjere s "
"nativnim programima, Electron aplikacijama i preglednikom."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:362
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Rješavanje problema"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:365
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Why can't my agent see the REA tools?"
msgstr "Zašto moj agent ne vidi REA alate?"

#. {ph0}: <code>doctor</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:366
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Restart or reconnect your agent after setup. Check its REA registration with"
" {ph0}; for Codex:"
msgstr ""
"Nakon postavljanja ponovno pokreni ili ponovno poveži agenta. Njegovu REA "
"registraciju provjeri pomoću {ph0}; za Codex:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:372
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · check one client"
msgstr "Terminal · provjera jednog klijenta"

#. {ph0}: <code>codex</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>claude_code</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>cursor</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:384
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace {ph0} with your client ID, such as {ph1} or {ph2}. If the report "
"shows a missing or stale registration, run setup for that client:"
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni {ph0} ID-jem svog klijenta, na primjer {ph1} ili {ph2}. Ako "
"izvješće pokaže nedostajuću ili zastarjelu registraciju, pokreni "
"postavljanje za tog klijenta:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:392
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · repair one client's setup"
msgstr "Terminal · popravak postavljanja jednog klijenta"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#help">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:404
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review its plan and restart the client. If registration is healthy but tools"
" remain absent, check the client's MCP connection error. {ph0}More setup "
"diagnostics{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Pregledaj njegov plan i ponovno pokreni klijenta. Ako je registracija "
"ispravna, a alati i dalje nedostaju, provjeri grešku MCP veze klijenta. "
"{ph0}Više dijagnostike postavljanja{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:412
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Do I need to start Hopper first?"
msgstr "Moram li prvo pokrenuti Hopper?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#native">
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:413
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA starts Hopper when an operation needs it. On macOS, complete the first-"
"run choice of demo mode or license activation before unattended analysis. "
"{ph0}See native provider setup{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"REA pokreće Hopper kada ga neka operacija zahtijeva. Na macOS-u prije "
"analize bez nadzora dovrši prvi odabir: demo način ili aktivaciju licence. "
"{ph0}Pogledaj postavljanje nativnog providera{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:422
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What should I do if I hit a bug?"
msgstr "Što da radim ako naiđem na grešku?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#update">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:423
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Update REA{ph1}, restart your agent and retry the same task. A recent "
"release may already fix the problem."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Ažuriraj REA{ph1}, ponovno pokreni agenta i ponovi isti zadatak. "
"Nedavno izdanje možda već popravlja problem."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/issues/new/choose" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:427
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"If it persists, {ph0}open an issue{ph1} with your REA version, operating "
"system, target type, steps to reproduce and error output. Include the "
"provider name when the problem involves native analysis."
msgstr ""
"Ako se problem nastavi, {ph0}otvori issue{ph1} s verzijom REA, operacijskim "
"sustavom, vrstom cilja, koracima za reprodukciju i ispisom greške. Navedi i "
"naziv providera ako se problem odnosi na nativnu analizu."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:441
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Data and sharing"
msgstr "Podaci i dijeljenje"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:444
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Does REA upload my app?"
msgstr "Šalje li REA moju aplikaciju na poslužitelj?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:445
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA analyzes targets on your machine. Your agent receives the results, and "
"its model provider's data policy applies to those results."
msgstr ""
"REA analizira ciljeve na tvojem računalu. Agent prima rezultate, a na njih "
"se primjenjuje politika o podacima pružatelja njegova modela."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:452
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "How can I share an example or contribute?"
msgstr "Kako mogu podijeliti primjer ili doprinijeti?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/issues/new/choose" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/pulls">
#. {ph3}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:453
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Have a useful REA example? We'd love to see it. Share the target, your "
"question, the findings and how you checked them in an {ph0}issue{ph1} or "
"{ph2}pull request{ph3}. Short code excerpts and figures help others follow "
"the investigation."
msgstr ""
"Imaš koristan primjer s REA? Rado bismo ga vidjeli. Podijeli cilj, svoje "
"pitanje, nalaze i način njihove provjere u {ph0}issueu{ph1} ili {ph2}pull "
"requestu{ph3}. Kratki isječci koda i slike pomažu drugima da prate "
"istraživanje."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:465
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Bug reports, feature requests, documentation and code improvements are "
"welcome too. To discuss an example first, open an issue in the repository."
msgstr ""
"Rado primamo i prijave grešaka, zahtjeve za značajke, dokumentaciju i "
"poboljšanja koda. Ako prvo želiš razgovarati o primjeru, otvori issue u "
"repozitoriju."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:6
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "REA FAQ: Setup, Updates and Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Česta pitanja o REA: postavljanje, ažuriranja i rješavanje problema"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:7
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Answers to common REA questions: installation, updates, analysis tools, "
