msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Tvoj agent za programiranje"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:151
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:173
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:201
