#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:160
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Install REA and connect it to this coding agent using {ph3}."
" Show me the setup plan for approval, then verify the "
"installation.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Instaliraj REA i poveži ga s ovim agentom za programiranje "
"naredbom {ph3}. Pokaži mi plan postavljanja na odobrenje, a zatim provjeri "
"instalaciju.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:170
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Or run this command in your terminal:"
msgstr "Ili pokreni ovu naredbu u terminalu:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:182
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the plan, approve the setup, then restart your agent. Already "
"connected? Continue below."
msgstr ""
"Pregledaj plan, odobri postavljanje, a zatim ponovno pokreni agenta. Već je "
"povezan? Nastavi u nastavku."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:188
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "2. Ask where the CSV is written"
msgstr "2. Pitaj gdje se CSV zapisuje"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:189
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The example is a six-file Electron app with an {ph0}Export notes{ph1} "
"button. Your agent can inspect its code without installing or launching "
"Electron."
msgstr ""
"Primjer je Electron aplikacija sa šest datoteka i gumbom {ph0}Export "
"notes{ph1}. Tvoj agent može pregledati njezin kod bez instaliranja ili "
"pokretanja Electrona."

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-analysis-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no" >https://rea.tools/examples/notes-
#. example.zip</span >
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">notes.csv</span>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph7}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:210
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Download {ph3} into a new example folder and unpack it. Use "
"REA to find what happens when I click Export notes. Show where {ph4} is "
"written, which fields it contains, and the relevant files and "
"lines.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Preuzmi {ph3} u novu mapu primjera i raspakiraj ga. Pomoću "
"REA pronađi što se događa kad kliknem Export notes. Pokaži gdje se zapisuje "
"{ph4}, koja polja sadrži te relevantne datoteke i retke.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:224
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent downloads the files and gives the unpacked folder to REA for "
"inspection."
msgstr ""
"Tvoj agent preuzima datoteke i predaje raspakiranu mapu REA na pregled."

#. {ph0}: <a class="button" href="../examples/notes-example.zip"
#. download="notes-example.zip" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:228
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download example ZIP{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Preuzmi ZIP s primjerom{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:236
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"If your agent can’t download files, unzip this archive yourself. Give it the"
" path to the {ph0} folder and the same export question."
msgstr ""
"Ako tvoj agent ne može preuzimati datoteke, raspakiraj ovu arhivu ručno. "
"Agentu zadaj putanju do mape {ph0} i isto pitanje o izvozu."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:243
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "3. Follow the answer back to the code"
msgstr "3. Prati odgovor do koda"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:244
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Look for a short explanation with file and line references:"
msgstr "Potraži kratko objašnjenje s referencama na datoteke i retke:"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>notes.csv</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>id</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>title</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:246
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The button sends a {ph0} message. The main process formats the notes as CSV "
"and writes {ph1} in the user’s Downloads folder. The columns are {ph2} and "
"{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"Gumb šalje poruku {ph0}. Glavni proces formatira bilješke kao CSV i zapisuje"
" {ph1} u korisnikovu mapu Downloads. Stupci su {ph2} i {ph3}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:254
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "From the button to the file writer"
msgstr "Od gumba do zapisivanja datoteke"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label" >
#. {ph1}: <span translate="no">renderer.js</span>
#. {ph2}: </span >
#. {ph3}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: <code>notes.exportCsv()</code>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:256
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Page · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Export notes{ph4}{ph5}Calls {ph6}.{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Stranica · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Export notes{ph4}{ph5}Poziva {ph6}.{ph7}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label" >
#. {ph1}: <span translate="no">preload.js</span>
#. {ph2}: </span >
#. {ph3}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph4}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:264
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Bridge · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Sends a named message to the "
"main process.{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Most · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Šalje imenovanu poruku glavnom "
"procesu.{ph7}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label" >
#. {ph1}: <span translate="no">main.js</span>
#. {ph2}: </span >
#. {ph3}: <span class="flow-node" >
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">notes.csv</span>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph7}: <code>csv.js</code>
#. {ph8}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:272
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Handler · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Write {ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Calls the formatter in "
"{ph7} and writes the file.{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Handler · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Zapiši {ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Poziva formatirač u "
"{ph7} i zapisuje datoteku.{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:283
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA’s static analysis pairs the message with its handler. The destination is"
" read from code."
msgstr ""
"Statička analiza REA povezuje poruku s njezinim handlerom. Odredište se čita"
" iz koda."

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">main.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:290
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} · lines 8–12"
msgstr "{ph0} · retci 8–12"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:291
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Izvorni kod"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:299
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The file path, formatter and write call are together in this handler. Ask "
"your agent to show these lines if its answer leaves them out."
msgstr ""
"Putanja datoteke, formatirač i poziv za zapisivanje nalaze se zajedno u ovom"
" handleru. Zamoli agenta da prikaže ove retke ako ih izostavi u odgovoru."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/#follow" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:304
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full code trace and recorded REA result{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}Pogledaj cijeli trag koda i zabilježeni rezultat REA{ph1}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:311
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "4. Check a prediction"
msgstr "4. Provjeri predviđanje"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:312
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"A comma separates CSV columns. What happens when a note title itself "
"contains a comma or quotation marks?"
msgstr ""
"Zarez odvaja CSV stupce. Što se događa kada sam naslov bilješke sadrži zarez"
" ili navodnike?"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-check-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no">Hello, "REA"</span>
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">toCsv</span>
#. {ph5}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#. {ph7}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph8}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:332
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Predict the CSV for a note with id 1 and title {ph3}. Then "
"run the example’s {ph4} formatter with {ph5} to check it. Show the "
"prediction and actual output.{ph6}{ph7}{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Predvidi CSV za bilješku s ID-jem 1 i naslovom {ph3}. Zatim "
"pokreni formatirač {ph4} iz primjera pomoću {ph5} da to provjeriš. Pokaži "
"predviđanje i stvarni ispis.{ph6}{ph7}{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:345
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Expected formatter output"
msgstr "Očekivani ispis formatirača"

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:350
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The title stays in one quoted field; each quotation mark is doubled. This "
"checks the formatter directly with {ph0}."
msgstr ""
"Naslov ostaje u jednom polju pod navodnicima; svaki navodnik je udvostručen."
" Time se formatirač izravno provjerava pomoću {ph0}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:356
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Run the check yourself"
msgstr "Pokreni provjeru na vlastitu ruku"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:357
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Open a terminal in the unpacked {ph0} folder:"
msgstr "Otvori terminal u raspakiranoj mapi {ph0}:"

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:363
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} · CSV formatter"
msgstr "{ph0} · CSV formatirač"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:379
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"This command uses a shell with here-document support, such as Bash or Zsh. "
"Your agent can run the same JavaScript in your platform’s shell."
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba koristi ljusku s podrškom za here-document, primjerice Bash ili "
"Zsh. Tvoj agent može pokrenuti isti JavaScript u ljusci tvoje platforme."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:387
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "5. Ask another question"
msgstr "5. Postavi još jedno pitanje"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:388
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Try a follow-up in the same conversation:"
msgstr "Isprobaj dodatno pitanje u istom razgovoru:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:390
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"What happens if the file can’t be written? Follow the error back to the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Što se događa ako se datoteka ne može zapisati? Prati grešku do stranice."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:395
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Or give your agent an app of your own and ask about one button, file or "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Ili svom agentu daj vlastitu aplikaciju i pitaj o jednom gumbu, datoteci ili"
" ponašanju."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/notion/">
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <span >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:400
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}How Notion copies text and HTML{ph1}{ph2}Follow a clipboard feature in "
"a packaged Electron app.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Kako Notion kopira tekst i HTML{ph1}{ph2}Prati značajku međuspremnika u"
" pakiranoj Electron aplikaciji.{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/dx-ball/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <span >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:406
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}How DX-Ball calculates sound panning{ph1}{ph2}Read the original "
"instructions and the reconstruction’s checks.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Kako DX-Ball izračunava panoramiranje zvuka{ph1}{ph2}Pročitaj izvorne "
"instrukcije i provjere rekonstrukcije.{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../faq/#troubleshooting" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <span >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:414
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Troubleshoot setup or analysis{ph1}{ph2}Update REA and check the "
"connection if you get stuck.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Rješavanje problema s postavljanjem ili analizom{ph1}{ph2}Ažuriraj REA "
"i provjeri vezu ako zapneš.{ph3}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:6
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Your First Reverse Engineering Investigation — REA"
msgstr "Tvoje prvo istraživanje obrnutim inženjeringom | REA"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:7
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Try REA on a small Notes app. Set up your agent, ask where exported notes "
"go, and check the CSV formatter with a sample title."
msgstr ""
"Isprobaj REA na maloj aplikaciji za bilješke. Postavi agenta, pitaj kamo idu"
" izvezene bilješke i provjeri CSV formatirač s probnim naslovom."

