#: website/public/get-started/index.html:281
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Use the CLI{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Koristi CLI{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:282
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Set up native analysis{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Postavi nativnu analizu{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#help">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:283
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Getting help{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Potraži pomoć{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:288
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect your coding agent"
msgstr "Poveži svog agenta za programiranje"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:289
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Run setup to connect REA to your coding agent. Client choices include Claude"
" Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Grok Build, and other supported "
"MCP clients. Grok Bot's connector is added from its chat."
msgstr ""
"Pokreni postavljanje kako bi REA povezao sa svojim agentom za programiranje."
" Među klijentima su Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Grok "
"Build i drugi podržani MCP klijenti. Konektor za Grok Bot dodaje se iz "
"njegova chata."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:296
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "New to coding agents?"
msgstr "Prvi put čuješ za agente za programiranje?"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:297
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"A coding agent is an AI assistant that works on your computer instead of in "
"a browser tab. It can read files and run commands, and it asks before making"
" changes. REA gives it reverse-engineering tools."
msgstr ""
"Agent za programiranje je AI asistent koji radi na tvom računalu, a ne u "
"kartici preglednika. Može čitati datoteke i izvršavati naredbe, a prije "
"svake izmjene pita za dopuštenje. REA mu daje alate za obrnuti inženjering."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:303
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"If you don't have one yet, pick one, follow its install page and sign in:"
msgstr ""
"Ako ga još nemaš, odaberi jednog, slijedi njegovu stranicu s uputama za "
"instalaciju i prijavi se:"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup" >
#. {ph2}: </a >
#. {ph3}: </strong >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:308
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Claude Code{ph2}{ph3} by Anthropic. Needs a paid Claude plan."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Claude Code{ph2}{ph3} tvrtke Anthropic. Zahtijeva plaćeni Claude "
"plan."

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://github.com/openai/codex">
#. {ph2}: </a>
#. {ph3}: </strong >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:316
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Codex{ph2}{ph3} by OpenAI. Sign in with your ChatGPT account."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Codex{ph2}{ph3} tvrtke OpenAI. Prijavi se svojim ChatGPT računom."

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://opencode.ai/docs">
#. {ph2}: </a>
#. {ph3}: </strong >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:322
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}OpenCode{ph2}{ph3}, open source. Connect the model provider of "
"your choice."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1}OpenCode{ph2}{ph3}, otvorenog koda. Poveži pružatelja modela po "
"svom izboru."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:328
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Then open it and copy the prompt below into it. The agent runs REA's setup "
"and shows you the plan before changing anything."
msgstr ""
"Zatim ga otvori i u njega kopiraj donji upit. Agent pokreće postavljanje "
"alata REA i prikazuje ti plan prije nego što išta promijeni."

#. {ph0}: <span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true" >
#. {ph1}: <i>
#. {ph2}: </i>
#. {ph3}: <i>
#. {ph4}: </i>
#. {ph5}: <i>
#. {ph6}: </i>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:335
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Your coding agent"
msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Tvoj agent za programiranje"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="agent-install-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no">npx rea-agents@latest setup</span>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph6}: </span>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:349
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Install REA and connect it to this coding agent using {ph3}."
" Show me the setup plan for approval, then verify the "
"installation.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Instaliraj REA i poveži ga s ovim agentom za programiranje "
"pomoću {ph3}. Pokaži mi plan postavljanja na odobrenje, a zatim provjeri "
"instalaciju.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:360
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Or run setup yourself"
msgstr "Ili sam pokreni postavljanje"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:362
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I open a terminal?"
msgstr "Kako otvoriti terminal?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:364
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} open the Start menu, type {ph2}PowerShell{ph3} and press "
"Enter."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} otvori izbornik Start, upiši {ph2}PowerShell{ph3} i "
"pritisni Enter."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Space</kbd>
#. {ph4}: <em>
#. {ph5}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:368
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} press {ph2} {ph3}, type {ph4}Terminal{ph5} and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} pritisni {ph2} {ph3}, upiši {ph4}Terminal{ph5} i pritisni "
"Enter."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Alt</kbd>
#. {ph4}: <kbd>T</kbd>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:372
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Linux:{ph1} press {ph2} {ph3} {ph4} on most desktops."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Linux:{ph1} na većini radnih okruženja pritisni {ph2} {ph3} {ph4}."

#. {ph0}: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>
#. {ph1}: <kbd>V</kbd>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>V</kbd>
#. {ph4}: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>
#. {ph5}: <kbd>Shift</kbd>
#. {ph6}: <kbd>V</kbd>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:377
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Paste a command with {ph0} {ph1} (macOS: {ph2} {ph3}; Linux terminals: {ph4}"
" {ph5} {ph6}), then press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Zalijepi naredbu pomoću {ph0} {ph1} (macOS: {ph2} {ph3}; Linux terminali: "
"{ph4} {ph5} {ph6}), a zatim pritisni Enter."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:398
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Choose your client and review the setup plan. REA adds its MCP connection "
"and the matching investigation skill, keeping a backup of existing "
"configuration. It asks before applying the changes."
msgstr ""
"Odaberi svoj klijent i pregledaj plan postavljanja. REA dodaje svoju MCP "
"vezu i odgovarajuću vještinu za istraživanje te čuva sigurnosnu kopiju "
"postojeće konfiguracije. Prije primjene promjena traži tvoje odobrenje."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:403
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Restart your client when setup finishes."
msgstr "Kad se postavljanje završi, ponovno pokreni svoj klijent."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:405
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I restart my client?"
msgstr "Kako ponovno pokrenuti klijent?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Q</kbd>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:406
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Desktop apps{ph1} (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, VS Code): quit the"
" app completely, then open it again. Closing the window isn't enough. On "
"macOS press {ph2} {ph3}; on Windows, also quit from the tray icon if there "
"is one."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Desktop aplikacije{ph1} (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, VS Code): "
"potpuno zatvori aplikaciju, a zatim je ponovno otvori. Zatvaranje prozora "
"nije dovoljno. Na macOS-u pritisni {ph2} {ph3}; na Windowsima izađi i iz "
"ikone u programskoj traci, ako je ima."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:413
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Terminal agents{ph1} (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI): exit the session"
" and start it again."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Terminalski agenti{ph1} (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI): izađi iz "
"sesije i ponovno je pokreni."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:418
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Give your agent a target path and a specific question. For a JavaScript or "
"Electron app, you might start with:"
msgstr ""
"Daj svom agentu putanju do cilja i konkretno pitanje. Za JavaScript ili "
"Electron aplikaciju možeš početi ovako:"

#. {ph0}: <code>/absolute/path/to/app</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:423
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Look at {ph0} and find how it exports data. Show the entry points, calls and"
" dependencies involved, with the source locations for your findings."
msgstr ""
"Pogledaj {ph0} i otkrij kako izvozi podatke. Pokaži ulazne točke, pozive i "
"ovisnosti, uz lokacije u izvornom kodu za svoje nalaze."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:429
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Replace the path with your local target."
msgstr "Zamijeni putanju svojim lokalnim ciljem."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:431
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I get a folder's full path?"
msgstr "Kako dobiti punu putanju mape?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:433
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} in File Explorer, right-click the folder and choose "
"{ph2}Copy as path{ph3}. On Windows 10, hold Shift while right-clicking."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} u File Exploreru desnom tipkom miša klikni mapu i odaberi"
" {ph2}Copy as path{ph3}. U sustavu Windows 10 drži Shift dok desnom tipkom "
"miša klikaš."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:438
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} in Finder, right-click the folder, hold Option and choose "
"{ph2}Copy \"…\" as Pathname{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} u Finderu desnom tipkom miša klikni mapu, drži Option i "
"odaberi {ph2}Copy \"…\" as Pathname{ph3}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:442
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Any system:{ph1} drag the folder into a terminal window and its path "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Bilo koji sustav:{ph1} povuci mapu u prozor terminala i pojavit će se "
"njezina putanja."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:447
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "In a terminal, put quotes around a path that contains spaces."
msgstr "U terminalu stavi putanju koja sadrži razmake u navodnike."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:454
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Use the CLI"
msgstr "Koristi CLI"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:455
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Analyze a JavaScript or Electron application folder or ASAR archive without "
"running the app:"
msgstr ""
"Analiziraj mapu JavaScript ili Electron aplikacije ili ASAR arhivu bez "
"pokretanja aplikacije:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:461
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Static application analysis"
msgstr "Statička analiza aplikacije"

#. {ph0}: <code>.asar</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>"D:/apps/example"</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:474
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with your extracted app directory or {ph0} file. On "
"Windows, a path such as {ph1} works here."
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni putanju svojom izdvojenom mapom aplikacije ili datotekom {ph0}. Na "
"Windowsima ovdje radi i putanja poput {ph1}."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:480
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Where do I find an app's .asar file?"
msgstr "Gdje pronaći .asar datoteku aplikacije?"

#. {ph0}: <code>resources</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:481
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Electron apps usually keep it in a {ph0} folder:"
msgstr "Electron aplikacije je obično čuvaju u mapi {ph0}:"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code
#. >C:\Users\&lt;you&gt;\AppData\Local\Programs\&lt;App&gt;\resources\app.asar</code
#. >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:486
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Windows:{ph1} {ph2}"
msgstr "{ph0}Windows:{ph1} {ph2}"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code
#. >/Applications/&lt;App&gt;.app/Contents/Resources/app.asar</code >
#. {ph3}: <em>
#. {ph4}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:492
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} {ph2} (right-click the app and choose {ph3}Show Package "
"Contents{ph4})"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} {ph2} (desnom tipkom miša klikni aplikaciju i odaberi "
"{ph3}Show Package Contents{ph4})"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>/opt/&lt;App&gt;/resources/app.asar</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:500
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Linux:{ph1} often {ph2}"
msgstr "{ph0}Linux:{ph1} često {ph2}"

#. {ph0}: <code>app.asar</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:505
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Some apps install elsewhere. Search the app's folder for {ph0}."
msgstr ""
"Neke se aplikacije instaliraju drugdje. U mapi aplikacije potraži {ph0}."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:510
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"The result identifies the app, shows connections between modules and gives "
"their source locations. Connections REA cannot resolve are marked in the "
"result."
msgstr ""
"Rezultat identificira aplikaciju, prikazuje veze među modulima i navodi "
"njihove lokacije u izvornom kodu. Veze koje REA ne može razriješiti označene"
" su u rezultatu."

#. {ph0}: <code>rea</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:515
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "If you'd like a permanent {ph0} command in your shell:"
msgstr "Ako želiš trajnu naredbu {ph0} u svom shellu:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:520
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Install the CLI"
msgstr "Instaliraj CLI"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:532
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Continue with the JavaScript application guide{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Nastavi s vodičem za JavaScript aplikacije{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:540
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Set up native analysis"
msgstr "Postavi nativnu analizu"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:541
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Native binaries need a local analysis tool. Choose and configure one below, "
"then give REA your executable or library."
msgstr ""
"Nativne binarne datoteke zahtijevaju lokalni alat za analizu. Odaberi i "
"konfiguriraj jedan od donjih, a zatim alatu REA daj svoju izvršnu datoteku "
"ili biblioteku."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:546
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Choose a tool: Ghidra, Hopper or IDA"
msgstr "Odaberi alat: Ghidra, Hopper ili IDA"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:551
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Use an existing Ghidra 12.1.x installation and a 64-bit JDK 21 or newer on "
"Linux or macOS, on x64 or arm64. Your Ghidra installation needs a native "
"decompiler for your host architecture. Set the paths before running setup:"
msgstr ""
"Koristi postojeću instalaciju alata Ghidra 12.1.x i 64-bitni JDK 21 ili "
"noviji na Linuxu ili macOS-u, na arhitekturi x64 ili arm64. Tvoja "
"instalacija alata Ghidra treba nativni dekompilator za arhitekturu tvog "
"računala. Postavi putanje prije pokretanja postavljanja:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:558
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect your Ghidra installation"
msgstr "Poveži svoju instalaciju alata Ghidra"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:561
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Ghidra connection · macOS / Linux"
msgstr "Ghidra veza · macOS / Linux"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:576
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace both paths with your existing installations. Setup checks them and "
"records valid settings for your selected client. On Linux arm64, you may "
"need to build Ghidra's native decompiler separately."
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni obje putanje svojim postojećim instalacijama. Postavljanje ih "
"provjerava i bilježi važeće postavke za odabrani klijent. Na Linuxu arm64 "
"možda ćeš nativni dekompilator alata Ghidra morati zasebno izgraditi."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:584
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect Ghidra on Windows"
msgstr "Poveži alat Ghidra na Windowsima"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:585
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Windows x64 has experimental, read-only support for native x86 and x64 PE "
"applications and DLLs on fixed local NTFS drives. Use an existing Ghidra "
"12.1.x installation and a 64-bit JDK 21 or newer:"
msgstr ""
"Windows x64 ima eksperimentalnu podršku samo za čitanje za nativne x86 i x64"
" PE aplikacije i DLL-ove na fiksnim lokalnim NTFS pogonima. Koristi "
"postojeću instalaciju alata Ghidra 12.1.x i 64-bitni JDK 21 ili noviji:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:593
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Ghidra connection · Windows PowerShell"
msgstr "Ghidra veza · Windows PowerShell"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:608
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the two paths with your installations, then review setup's plan."
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni dvije putanje svojim instalacijama, a zatim pregledaj plan "
"postavljanja."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:618
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Connect Hopper on macOS or Linux. Run the setup command above; it detects an"
" existing installation or offers an installation plan for your approval."
msgstr ""
"Poveži Hopper na macOS-u ili Linuxu. Pokreni gornju naredbu za postavljanje;"
" ona prepoznaje postojeću instalaciju ili nudi plan instalacije na tvoje "
"odobrenje."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:623
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"On macOS, complete Hopper's first-run choice of demo mode or license "
"activation before an unattended analysis."
msgstr ""
"Na macOS-u prije nenadzirane analize obavi Hopperov odabir pri prvom "
"pokretanju: demo način rada ili aktivaciju licence."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:632
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"The verified IDA setups use Windows, with an existing MCP registration for "
"an attached GUI or a headless database. Linux and macOS headless analysis "
"remains unverified."
msgstr ""
"Provjerena IDA postavljanja koriste Windows, uz postojeću MCP registraciju "
"za priključeni GUI ili headless bazu podataka. Headless analiza na Linuxu i "
"macOS-u ostaje neprovjerena."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:638
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect an existing IDA MCP registration"
msgstr "Poveži postojeću IDA MCP registraciju"

#. {ph0}: <code>command</code>
