#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:263
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to find how DX-Ball calculates sound panning. "
"Explain the calculation and show the code.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Koristi REA da otkriješ kako DX-Ball izračunava zvučnu "
"panoramu. Objasni izračun i pokaži kod.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:271
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"Example prompt. Give your agent the path to your local DX-Ball 1.07 "
"executable. REA doesn't include DX-Ball, so use your own copy, or ask the "
"same kind of question about another small Windows program you have."
msgstr ""
"Primjer upita. Daj svom agentu putanju do lokalne izvršne datoteke igre DX-"
"Ball 1.07. REA ne uključuje DX-Ball, stoga upotrijebi vlastitu kopiju ili "
"postavi istu vrstu pitanja o nekom drugom malom Windows programu koji imaš."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:278
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "How do I get a file's full path?"
msgstr "Kako dobiti punu putanju datoteke?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:280
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} in File Explorer, right-click the file and choose "
"{ph2}Copy as path{ph3}. On Windows 10, hold Shift while right-clicking."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} u File Exploreru desnom tipkom miša klikni datoteku i "
"odaberi {ph2}Copy as path{ph3}. Na Windowsima 10 drži Shift dok klikaš "
"desnom tipkom miša."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:285
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} in Finder, right-click the file, hold Option and choose "
"{ph2}Copy \"…\" as Pathname{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} u Finderu desnom tipkom miša klikni datoteku, drži Option i"
" odaberi {ph2}Copy \"…\" as Pathname{ph3}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:289
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Any system:{ph1} drag the file into a terminal window and its path "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Bilo koji sustav:{ph1} povuci datoteku u prozor terminala i pojavit će "
"se njezina putanja."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:297
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Read the REA results"
msgstr "Pročitaj REA rezultate"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:298
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Read the input"
msgstr "Pročitaj ulaz"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:301
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "REA instruction excerpt · 0x406409"
msgstr "REA isječak instrukcija · 0x406409"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:307
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"The instructions load an integer argument and convert it for floating-point "
"arithmetic. This is the input absent from the first pseudocode view."
msgstr ""
"Instrukcije učitavaju cjelobrojni argument i pretvaraju ga za aritmetiku s "
"pomičnim zarezom. To je ulaz kojeg nema u prvom prikazu pseudokoda."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:312
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Follow the caller"
msgstr "Prati pozivatelja"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:315
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "REA caller excerpt · 0x411f5b"
msgstr "REA isječak pozivatelja · 0x411f5b"

#. {ph0}: <code>0x14</code>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:321
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA identifies the brick-hit caller. Its earlier instructions multiply the "
"tile coordinate by 30; adding {ph0} (20) gives the brick's screen position."
msgstr ""
"REA prepoznaje pozivatelja pri pogotku cigle. Njegove ranije instrukcije "
"množe koordinatu polja s 30; dodavanjem {ph0} (20) dobiva se položaj cigle "
"na zaslonu."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:326
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Read the referenced constants"
msgstr "Pročitaj referencirane konstante"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:329
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "REA byte results · interpreted as little-endian doubles"
msgstr ""
"REA rezultati bajtova · tumačeni kao little-endian vrijednosti tipa double"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:337
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"The arithmetic references these addresses. Reading the bytes supplies the "
"actual values; the instruction order tells the agent how they are used."
msgstr ""
"Aritmetika referencira ove adrese. Čitanjem bajtova dobivaju se stvarne "
"vrijednosti, a redoslijed instrukcija agentu govori kako se one koriste."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:344
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Write and check the recovered function"
msgstr "Napiši i provjeri rekonstruiranu funkciju"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:346
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Recovered C · excerpt"
msgstr "Rekonstruirani C · isječak"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:353
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"With a scale of 1.0, screen positions 0, 320 and 640 map to −500, 0 and 500 "
"before integer conversion. The calculation puts the center of the screen at "
"the center of the stereo field."
msgstr ""
"Uz mjerilo 1,0 položaji na zaslonu 0, 320 i 640 prije pretvorbe u cijeli "
"broj preslikavaju se u −500, 0 i 500. Izračun postavlja sredinu zaslona u "
"sredinu stereo polja."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:358
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"The agent used REA's findings to write the C. Separate checks compared 3,205"
" inputs against the original x86 function and reproduced all 63 compiled "
"bytes of the complete function."
msgstr ""
"Agent je na temelju REA nalaza napisao C kod. Zasebne provjere usporedile su"
" 3.205 ulaza s izvornom x86 funkcijom i reproducirale svih 63 prevedena "
"bajta cijele funkcije."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../showcase/dx-ball/#sound-pan" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:363
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full investigation and assembly-to-C comparison{ph1}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Pogledaj cijelo istraživanje i usporedbu asemblera s C kodom{ph1}"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:370
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Try it with your own binary"
msgstr "Isprobaj s vlastitom izvršnom datotekom"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../get-started/#native" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:371
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Connect a native analysis provider{ph1}, then give your agent a local "
"executable or library and a feature to investigate. Useful starting "
"questions include “How is this file parsed?” or “Which function handles this"
" menu action?”"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Poveži pružatelja nativne analize{ph1}, a zatim svom agentu daj lokalnu"
" izvršnu datoteku ili biblioteku i funkcionalnost koju treba istražiti. "
"Korisna početna pitanja su „Kako se ova datoteka parsira?” ili „Koja "
"funkcija obrađuje ovu radnju izbornika?”"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:378
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"If you already know a function name or address, you can query it from the "
"terminal. For a configured Ghidra installation:"
msgstr ""
"Ako već znaš naziv ili adresu funkcije, možeš je ispitati iz terminala. Za "
"konfiguriranu instalaciju Ghidre:"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:384
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Function analysis"
msgstr "Analiza funkcije"

#. {ph0}: <code>main</code>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:397
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the target path and {ph0} with your own function name or address. "
"Each CLI invocation imports and analyzes the binary, then closes its "
"session. Your agent's MCP queries reuse the imported binary while that "
"session is open."
msgstr ""
"Zamijeni ciljnu putanju i {ph0} vlastitim nazivom ili adresom funkcije. "
"Svako pokretanje CLI-ja uvozi i analizira binarnu datoteku, a zatim zatvara "
"svoju sesiju. MCP upiti tvog agenta ponovno koriste uvezenu binarnu datoteku"
" dok je ta sesija otvorena."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:403
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"Read the pseudocode alongside instructions and references. When a result "
"leaves a call or value unresolved, use that location as the next question."
msgstr ""
"Čitaj pseudokod zajedno s instrukcijama i referencama. Kada rezultat ostavi "
"poziv ili vrijednost neriješenima, to mjesto iskoristi kao sljedeće pitanje."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:6
