"The reference gives the agent a place to investigate, even though the "
"executable's original function names have been removed."
msgstr ""
"Referenca agentu daje mjesto za istraživanje, iako su izvorna imena funkcija"
" iz izvršne datoteke uklonjena."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:252
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Read the checker and its two helpers"
msgstr "Pročitaj provjeru i njezine dvije pomoćne funkcije"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:267
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "REA → agent · selected instructions"
msgstr "REA → agent · odabrane instrukcije"

#. {ph0}: <code>0x18</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>0x270</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:280
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The first loop copies 36 character codes. The checking loop decodes a mask, "
"sums the selected codes and compares the result with a stored number. Its "
"{ph0}-byte steps across {ph1} bytes give 26 masks."
msgstr ""
"Prva petlja kopira 36 kodova znakova. Petlja za provjeru dekodira masku, "
"zbraja odabrane kodove i uspoređuje rezultat sa spremljenim brojem. Njezini "
"koraci od {ph0} bajtova kroz {ph1} bajtova daju 26 maski."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:288
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"These are selected results from a fresh REA analysis. The local target path "
"is shortened for display; addresses refer to REA's imported image."
msgstr ""
"Ovo su odabrani rezultati nove REA analize. Lokalna putanja cilja skraćena "
"je radi prikaza; adrese se odnose na memorijski image koji je REA uvezao."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:296
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "One check reveals one character"
msgstr "Jedna provjera otkriva jedan znak"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:297
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The checker arranges the input in a 6×6 grid. A mask chooses which cells "
"contribute to a sum. Its compact encoding uses negative numbers to skip "
"cells and positive numbers to select them."
msgstr ""
"Provjera raspoređuje ulaz u mrežu 6×6. Maska bira koje ćelije doprinose "
"zbroju. Njezino kompaktno kodiranje koristi negativne brojeve za preskakanje"
" ćelija, a pozitivne za njihov odabir."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../assets/figures/ctf-mask-equation.svg" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:317
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "The seventh check selects just one position. {ph0}Open figure{ph1}."
msgstr "Sedma provjera bira samo jednu poziciju. {ph0}Otvori sliku{ph1}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:324
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Read the mask and its target from the binary"
msgstr "Pročitaj masku i njezin cilj iz binarne datoteke"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:330
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Agent → REA · read_bytes"
msgstr "Agent → REA · read_bytes"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:337
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "REA → agent · seventh entries"
msgstr "REA → agent · sedmi unosi"

#. {ph0}: <code>MOVSX</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>eb</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>code[21] = 55</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>7</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:346
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The instruction {ph0} reads mask bytes as signed values. This is why {ph1} "
"means −21. The target is a little-endian integer. Together, these bytes tell"
" the agent that {ph2}, so that character is {ph3}."
msgstr ""
"Instrukcija {ph0} čita bajtove maske kao vrijednosti s predznakom. Zato "
"{ph1} znači −21. Cilj je cijeli broj u little-endian zapisu. Zajedno ti "
"bajtovi agentu govore da je {ph2}, pa je taj znak {ph3}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:355
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "From instructions to a readable check"
msgstr "Od instrukcija do čitljive provjere"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:356
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"Select a step to connect the summing helper and its caller to the same rule "
"in C."
msgstr ""
"Odaberi korak da povežeš pomoćnu funkciju za zbrajanje i funkciju koja je "
"poziva s istim pravilom u C-u."

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:366
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01{ph1} Start"
msgstr "{ph0}01{ph1} Početak"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:374
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}02{ph1} Select"
msgstr "{ph0}02{ph1} Odabir"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:382
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}03{ph1} Add"
msgstr "{ph0}03{ph1} Zbrajanje"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:390
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}04{ph1} Advance"
msgstr "{ph0}04{ph1} Pomak"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:398
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}05{ph1} Compare"
msgstr "{ph0}05{ph1} Usporedba"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:410
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "REA · selected original instructions"
msgstr "REA · odabrane izvorne instrukcije"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:434
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Readable C · one-check summary"
msgstr "Čitljiv C · sažetak jedne provjere"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>ECX</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:463
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01 · Start at zero.{ph1} {ph2} holds the running sum."
msgstr "{ph0}01 · Kreni od nule.{ph1} {ph2} drži tekući zbroj."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:467
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Check the mask cell.{ph1} A zero value skips the character; a "
"nonzero value includes it."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 · Provjeri ćeliju maske.{ph1} Vrijednost nula preskače znak, a "
"vrijednost različita od nule uključuje ga."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:471
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Add a character code.{ph1} The input's integer at the same offset "
"is added to the sum."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 · Dodaj kod znaka.{ph1} Cijeli broj iz ulaza na istom offsetu dodaje"
" se zbroju."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:475
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Move to the next cell.{ph1} The original loop advances four bytes "
"per integer and visits six rows of six cells."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 · Prijeđi na sljedeću ćeliju.{ph1} Izvorna petlja pomiče se za "
"četiri bajta po cijelom broju i obilazi šest redaka od po šest ćelija."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>EAX</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>Incorrect!</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:480
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Compare with the stored target.{ph1} The caller receives the sum "
"in {ph2}. A mismatch jumps to {ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 · Usporedi sa spremljenim ciljem.{ph1} Pozivatelj dobiva zbroj u "
"{ph2}. Pri nepodudaranju skače se na {ph3}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:487
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The instructions come from the summing helper and its caller. The C is an "
"explanatory summary with descriptive names and a flattened 36-cell loop."
msgstr ""
"Instrukcije potječu iz pomoćne funkcije za zbrajanje i funkcije koja je "
"poziva. C kod je objašnjavajući sažetak s opisnim imenima i izravnatom "
"petljom od 36 ćelija."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:495
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Solve the 26 equations"
msgstr "Riješi 26 jednadžbi"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:496
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"Most masks select several cells. For example, the first check adds 16 "
"character codes and requires a total of 1441. The overlapping selections "
"give equations that a small Python script can solve together."
msgstr ""
"Većina maski bira više ćelija. Na primjer, prva provjera zbraja 16 kodova "
"znakova i zahtijeva ukupno 1441. Preklapajući odabiri daju jednadžbe koje "
"malena Python skripta može riješiti zajedno."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:504
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Python · solver excerpt"
msgstr "Python · isječak rješavača"

#. {ph0}: <code>DUCTF{…}</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:532
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"Z3 is a solver that finds values satisfying these equations. This excerpt "
"uses the extracted checks and assumes a {ph0} flag with letters, digits, "
"underscores and braces. The complete download includes all 26 masks and "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"Z3 je rješavač koji pronalazi vrijednosti koje zadovoljavaju ove jednadžbe. "
"Ovaj isječak koristi izvučene provjere i pretpostavlja zastavicu oblika "
"{ph0} sa slovima, znamenkama, podcrtama i vitičastim zagradama. Cjelovito "
"preuzimanje sadrži svih 26 maski i ciljeva."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:538
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Download the complete solver"
msgstr "Preuzmi cijeli rješavač"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:544
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Check the answer with the original program"
msgstr "Provjeri odgovor izvornim programom"

#. {ph0}: <code>z</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>y</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:545
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
