#. {ph4}: <code>x</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:445
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Read the input.{ph1} The instruction view in REA's function result"
" reads {ph2} and uses {ph3} to load the integer. Following its caller "
"through REA establishes the screen-coordinate meaning of the C parameter "
"{ph4}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 · Pročitaj ulaz.{ph1} Prikaz instrukcija u rezultatu za funkciju iz "
"alata REA čita {ph2} i koristi {ph3} za učitavanje cijelog broja. Praćenje "
"njezina pozivatelja pomoću REA utvrđuje značenje C parametra {ph4} kao "
"koordinate zaslona."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420068</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>read_bytes</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.5625</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:452
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Multiply by 1.5625.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. The "
"bytes returned by REA's {ph4} decode to {ph5}; the C uses the same constant."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 · Pomnoži s 1,5625.{ph1} {ph2} čita double na adresi {ph3}. Bajtovi "
"koje vraća {ph4} u alatu REA dekodiraju se u {ph5}; C koristi istu "
"konstantu."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FSUB</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420070</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>500.0</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>320</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:458
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Subtract 500.0.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. REA's byte "
"result decodes to {ph4}, shifting the calculation's center to screen "
"coordinate {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 · Oduzmi 500,0.{ph1} {ph2} čita double na adresi {ph3}. Rezultat "
"bajtova iz alata REA dekodira se u {ph4}, čime se središte izračuna pomiče "
"na koordinatu zaslona {ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x4210a0</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>dxball_pan_scale</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.0</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:464
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Apply the stored scale.{ph1} The second {ph2} reads {ph3}. That "
"global is named {ph4} in the maintained source. REA's second byte read "
"establishes its initial value of {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 · Primijeni spremljenu skalu.{ph1} Druga instrukcija {ph2} čita "
"{ph3}. Ta se globalna varijabla u održavanom izvornom kodu zove {ph4}. Drugo"
" čitanje bajtova u alatu REA utvrđuje njezinu početnu vrijednost {ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>0x406430</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>__ftol</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>DxBallInt</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:471
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Return an integer.{ph1} The call at {ph2} reaches {ph3}, "
"identified in REA's callee results. The C casts the result to {ph4}; "
"original-x86 comparisons check the returned value."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 · Vrati cijeli broj.{ph1} Poziv na {ph2} dolazi do {ph3}, što je "
"utvrđeno u rezultatima alata REA za pozivane funkcije. C rezultat pretvara u"
" {ph4}, a usporedbe s izvornim x86 kodom provjeravaju vraćenu vrijednost."

