#. {ph0}: <code>0, 16, 32, …, 240</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:215
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"TH04 stores a full clockwise turn in 256 angle units. For 16 bullets, each "
"index adds 16 units: {ph0}. Adding the player's direction rotates those "
"positions together."
msgstr ""
"TH04 sprema puni okret u smjeru kazaljke na satu u 256 jedinica kuta. Za 16 "
"metaka svaki indeks dodaje 16 jedinica: {ph0}. Dodavanjem smjera igrača te "
"se pozicije zajedno zakreću."

