msgid "Readable C++ · aimed-ring summary"
msgstr "Čitljivi C++ · sažetak ciljanog prstena"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>SI</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:488
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Read the bullet index.{ph1} The stack argument is loaded into "
"{ph2}. In a 16-bullet ring, this member index runs from 0 through 15."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 · Pročitaj indeks metka.{ph1} Argument sa stoga učitava se u {ph2}. "
"U prstenu od 16 metaka ovaj indeks člana ide od 0 do 15."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>SHL AX,8</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>IDIV</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:493
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Space the directions around a full turn.{ph1} {ph2} multiplies by "
"256. The count is zero-extended into a word, then {ph3} divides the product "
"by that count. For count 16, each index advances 16 angle units."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 · Raspodijeli smjerove po punom okretu.{ph1} {ph2} množi s 256. Broj"
" se nulama proširuje u riječ, a zatim {ph3} dijeli umnožak tim brojem. Za "
"broj 16 svaki indeks pomiče kut za 16 jedinica."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>AX</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:500
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Add the player direction.{ph1} The two subtractions form player-"
"minus-origin coordinates. The direction helper returns an angle in {ph2}; "
"adding it turns the whole ring toward the player."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 · Dodaj smjer igrača.{ph1} Dva oduzimanja daju koordinate oblika "
"igrač minus ishodište. Pomoćna funkcija za smjer vraća kut u {ph2}; njegovim"
" se dodavanjem cijeli prsten okreće prema igraču."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>ADD AL,[0x53ad]</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:506
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Add the pattern's rotation.{ph1} {ph2} adds the template angle. "
"Elly's initial template sets it to zero; other patterns can use the same "
"helper with a rotation."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 · Dodaj rotaciju uzorka.{ph1} {ph2} dodaje kut predloška. Ellyin "
"početni predložak postavlja ga na nulu; drugi uzorci mogu koristiti istu "
"pomoćnu funkciju s rotacijom."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>AL</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:512
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Keep the final angle in one byte.{ph1} The store writes {ph2} to "
"the spawn-angle field. Values wrap after 255, just as the unsigned-byte cast"
" does. The surrounding source also converts this angle and speed into "
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 · Zadrži konačni kut u jednom bajtu.{ph1} Spremanje upisuje {ph2} u "
"polje kuta nastanka. Vrijednosti se vraćaju na početak nakon 255, baš kao i "
"pretvorba u bajt bez predznaka. Okolni izvorni kod ovaj kut i brzinu "
"pretvara i u vektor brzine."

#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:521
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"The assembly selects the aimed-ring branch, aim calculation and final store."
" The C++ above is a readable summary. Compiler checks below apply to the "
"maintained source in the linked project."
msgstr ""
"Asemblerski kod bira granu ciljanog prstena, izračun ciljanja i konačno "
"spremanje. C++ iznad je čitljiv sažetak. Provjere prevoditelja u nastavku "
"odnose se na održavani izvorni kod u povezanom projektu."

